<!-- ==================== BAB 1: PENDAHULUAN ==================== -->
<div class="page-break">
    <h2>1. Pendahuluan</h2>
    <p>
        Dokumen ini menyajikan <b>Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD)</b> dari aplikasi 
        <b>E-Absensi Siswa</b>, yaitu sistem informasi manajemen presensi siswa berbasis web 
        yang dirancang untuk mempermudah proses pencatatan kehadiran siswa dan guru di 
        lingkungan sekolah.
    </p>
    <p>
        ERD menggambarkan entitas-entitas utama dalam sistem beserta atribut dan relasi 
        antar entitas tersebut. Diagram ini menjadi acuan dalam perancangan basis data 
        (<i>database schema</i>) yang digunakan oleh aplikasi.
    </p>

    <div class="info-box">
        <b>Teknologi Database:</b> MySQL / MariaDB<br/>
        <b>Framework:</b> Laravel 12 (PHP)<br/>
        <b>Jumlah Entitas:</b> 15 tabel<br/>
        <b>Jumlah Relasi:</b> 18 relasi
    </div>

    <h2>2. Daftar Entitas</h2>
    <p>Berikut adalah daftar seluruh entitas (tabel) dalam sistem E-Absensi Siswa:</p>

    <table>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 5%;">No</th>
            <th style="width: 25%;">Nama Tabel</th>
            <th style="width: 25%;">Domain</th>
            <th style="width: 45%;">Keterangan</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td class="center">1</td><td><b>users</b></td><td>Autentikasi</td><td>Data seluruh pengguna sistem (6 role)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">2</td><td><b>classes</b></td><td>Akademik</td><td>Data kelas/rombongan belajar</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">3</td><td><b>students</b></td><td>Akademik</td><td>Data siswa</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">4</td><td><b>homeroom_teachers</b></td><td>Akademik</td><td>Penugasan wali kelas</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">5</td><td><b>parents</b></td><td>Orang Tua</td><td>Data orang tua/wali murid</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">6</td><td><b>parent_student</b></td><td>Orang Tua</td><td>Tabel pivot relasi orang tua ↔ siswa</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">7</td><td><b>absences</b></td><td>Absensi</td><td>Rekap absensi harian siswa</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">8</td><td><b>izin_requests</b></td><td>Absensi</td><td>Pengajuan izin/sakit siswa</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">9</td><td><b>settings</b></td><td>Konfigurasi</td><td>Pengaturan aplikasi (key-value)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">10</td><td><b>announcements</b></td><td>Informasi</td><td>Pengumuman sekolah</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">11</td><td><b>subjects</b></td><td>Akademik</td><td>Data mata pelajaran</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">12</td><td><b>schedules</b></td><td>Akademik</td><td>Jadwal pelajaran</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">13</td><td><b>teaching_journals</b></td><td>Mengajar</td><td>Jurnal mengajar guru</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">14</td><td><b>subject_attendances</b></td><td>Absensi</td><td>Absensi per mata pelajaran</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">15</td><td><b>teacher_attendances</b></td><td>Absensi</td><td>Absensi guru/staff</td></tr>
    </table>
</div>

<!-- ==================== BAB 3: DETAIL ENTITAS ==================== -->
<div class="page-break">
    <h2>3. Detail Entitas dan Atribut</h2>

    <!-- 3.1 USERS -->
    <h3>3.1. Tabel <span class="tabel-nama">users</span></h3>
    <p>Menyimpan data seluruh pengguna yang dapat mengakses sistem. Terdapat 6 jenis role pengguna.</p>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 5%;">No</th>
            <th style="width: 22%;">Nama Kolom</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;">Tipe Data</th>
            <th style="width: 10%;">Constraint</th>
            <th style="width: 48%;">Keterangan</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td class="center">1</td><td>id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-pk">PK</span></td><td>Primary key, auto increment</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">2</td><td>name</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>Nama lengkap pengguna</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">3</td><td>nip</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Nomor Induk Pegawai</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">4</td><td>email</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td><span class="badge-uk">UNIQUE</span></td><td>Alamat email (untuk login)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">5</td><td>password</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>Password terenkripsi (bcrypt)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">6</td><td>role</td><td>ENUM</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>super_admin, wali_kelas, orang_tua, guru, siswa, kepala_sekolah</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">7</td><td>is_approved</td><td>BOOLEAN</td><td>DEFAULT false</td><td>Status persetujuan akun</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">8</td><td>is_demo</td><td>BOOLEAN</td><td>DEFAULT false</td><td>Penanda akun demo</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">9</td><td>photo</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Path foto profil</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">10</td><td>email_verified_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu verifikasi email</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">11</td><td>remember_token</td><td>VARCHAR(100)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Token "Remember Me"</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">12</td><td>created_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu pembuatan record</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">13</td><td>updated_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu update terakhir</td></tr>
    </table>

    <!-- 3.2 CLASSES -->
    <h3>3.2. Tabel <span class="tabel-nama">classes</span></h3>
    <p>Menyimpan data kelas atau rombongan belajar di sekolah.</p>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 5%;">No</th>
            <th style="width: 22%;">Nama Kolom</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;">Tipe Data</th>
            <th style="width: 10%;">Constraint</th>
            <th style="width: 48%;">Keterangan</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td class="center">1</td><td>id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-pk">PK</span></td><td>Primary key, auto increment</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">2</td><td>name</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>Nama kelas (mis: X-IPA-1)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">3</td><td>grade</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>Tingkat kelas (X, XI, XII)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">4</td><td>major</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Jurusan (IPA, IPS, dll)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">5</td><td>description</td><td>TEXT</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Deskripsi kelas</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">6</td><td>status</td><td>ENUM</td><td>DEFAULT active</td><td>active / inactive</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">7</td><td>created_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu pembuatan record</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">8</td><td>updated_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu update terakhir</td></tr>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="page-break">
    <!-- 3.3 STUDENTS -->
    <h3>3.3. Tabel <span class="tabel-nama">students</span></h3>
    <p>Menyimpan data lengkap siswa. Setiap siswa memiliki barcode unik (UUID) yang di-generate otomatis.</p>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 5%;">No</th>
            <th style="width: 22%;">Nama Kolom</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;">Tipe Data</th>
            <th style="width: 10%;">Constraint</th>
            <th style="width: 48%;">Keterangan</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td class="center">1</td><td>id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-pk">PK</span></td><td>Primary key, auto increment</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">2</td><td>nisn</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>Nomor Induk Siswa Nasional</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">3</td><td>nis</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>Nomor Induk Siswa (lokal)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">4</td><td>name</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>Nama lengkap siswa</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">5</td><td>email</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Email siswa</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">6</td><td>gender</td><td>ENUM</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>L (Laki-laki) / P (Perempuan)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">7</td><td>class_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-fk">FK</span></td><td>→ classes.id</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">8</td><td>phone_number</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Nomor telepon/HP</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">9</td><td>address</td><td>TEXT</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Alamat tempat tinggal</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">10</td><td>birth_place</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Tempat lahir</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">11</td><td>birth_date</td><td>DATE</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Tanggal lahir</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">12</td><td>photo</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Path foto siswa</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">13</td><td>status</td><td>ENUM</td><td>DEFAULT active</td><td>active / inactive</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">14</td><td>barcode_data</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td><span class="badge-uk">UNIQUE</span></td><td>UUID unik untuk QR Code (auto-generated)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">15</td><td>created_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu pembuatan record</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">16</td><td>updated_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu update terakhir</td></tr>
    </table>

    <!-- 3.4 HOMEROOM_TEACHERS -->
    <h3>3.4. Tabel <span class="tabel-nama">homeroom_teachers</span></h3>
    <p>Tabel penugasan wali kelas. Menghubungkan satu user (guru) dengan satu kelas yang diampu.</p>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 5%;">No</th>
            <th style="width: 22%;">Nama Kolom</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;">Tipe Data</th>
            <th style="width: 10%;">Constraint</th>
            <th style="width: 48%;">Keterangan</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td class="center">1</td><td>id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-pk">PK</span></td><td>Primary key, auto increment</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">2</td><td>user_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-fk">FK</span></td><td>→ users.id (guru wali kelas)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">3</td><td>class_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-fk">FK</span></td><td>→ classes.id (kelas yang diampu), NULLABLE</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">4</td><td>created_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu pembuatan record</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">5</td><td>updated_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu update terakhir</td></tr>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="page-break">
    <!-- 3.5 PARENTS -->
    <h3>3.5. Tabel <span class="tabel-nama">parents</span></h3>
    <p>Data orang tua/wali murid. Setiap orang tua terhubung ke akun user dan dapat memiliki banyak anak (siswa).</p>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 5%;">No</th>
            <th style="width: 22%;">Nama Kolom</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;">Tipe Data</th>
            <th style="width: 10%;">Constraint</th>
            <th style="width: 48%;">Keterangan</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td class="center">1</td><td>id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-pk">PK</span></td><td>Primary key, auto increment</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">2</td><td>user_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-fk">FK</span></td><td>→ users.id (akun login orang tua)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">3</td><td>name</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>Nama orang tua</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">4</td><td>phone_number</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Nomor WhatsApp/HP</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">5</td><td>relation_status</td><td>VARCHAR(255)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Status hubungan (Ayah/Ibu/Wali)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">6</td><td>created_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu pembuatan record</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">7</td><td>updated_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu update terakhir</td></tr>
    </table>

    <!-- 3.6 PARENT_STUDENT -->
    <h3>3.6. Tabel <span class="tabel-nama">parent_student</span> (Pivot)</h3>
    <p>Tabel pivot untuk relasi Many-to-Many antara orang tua dan siswa. Satu orang tua dapat memiliki banyak anak, dan satu siswa dapat memiliki banyak orang tua/wali.</p>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 5%;">No</th>
            <th style="width: 22%;">Nama Kolom</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;">Tipe Data</th>
            <th style="width: 10%;">Constraint</th>
            <th style="width: 48%;">Keterangan</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td class="center">1</td><td>parent_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-fk">FK</span></td><td>→ parents.id</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">2</td><td>student_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-fk">FK</span></td><td>→ students.id</td></tr>
    </table>

    <!-- 3.7 ABSENCES -->
    <h3>3.7. Tabel <span class="tabel-nama">absences</span></h3>
    <p>Menyimpan data absensi harian siswa termasuk waktu masuk, pulang, status kehadiran, dan lokasi GPS.</p>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th style="width: 5%;">No</th>
            <th style="width: 22%;">Nama Kolom</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;">Tipe Data</th>
            <th style="width: 10%;">Constraint</th>
            <th style="width: 48%;">Keterangan</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td class="center">1</td><td>id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-pk">PK</span></td><td>Primary key, auto increment</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">2</td><td>student_id</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-fk">FK</span></td><td>→ students.id</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">3</td><td>attendance_time</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>Waktu check-in (masuk)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">4</td><td>checkout_time</td><td>DATETIME</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu check-out (pulang)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">5</td><td>status</td><td>ENUM</td><td>NOT NULL</td><td>hadir, terlambat, alpha, sakit, izin</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">6</td><td>late_duration</td><td>INTEGER</td><td>DEFAULT 0</td><td>Durasi terlambat (dalam menit)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">7</td><td>reason</td><td>TEXT</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Alasan ketidakhadiran</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">8</td><td>recorded_by</td><td>BIGINT</td><td><span class="badge-fk">FK</span></td><td>→ users.id (pencatat absensi)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">9</td><td>latitude</td><td>DECIMAL(10,8)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Koordinat GPS (lintang)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">10</td><td>longitude</td><td>DECIMAL(11,8)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Koordinat GPS (bujur)</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">11</td><td>ip_address</td><td>VARCHAR(45)</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Alamat IP perangkat</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">12</td><td>created_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu pembuatan record</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="center">13</td><td>updated_at</td><td>TIMESTAMP</td><td>NULLABLE</td><td>Waktu update terakhir</td></tr>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="page-break">
