    <h2>5. Diagram Notasi ERD</h2>
    <p>Berikut adalah representasi visual notasi ERD menggunakan simbol Chen / Crow's Foot:</p>

    <div class="info-box">
        <b>Keterangan Notasi:</b><br/><br/>
        <table style="border: none; font-size: 10pt;">
            <tr style="background: none;"><td style="border: none; width: 120pt;"><b>──||────||──</b></td><td style="border: none;">One-to-One (1:1) — Tepat satu di kedua sisi</td></tr>
            <tr style="background: none;"><td style="border: none;"><b>──||────|&lt;──</b></td><td style="border: none;">One-to-Many (1:N) — Satu ke banyak</td></tr>
            <tr style="background: none;"><td style="border: none;"><b>──&gt;|────|&lt;──</b></td><td style="border: none;">Many-to-Many (M:N) — Banyak ke banyak (via pivot)</td></tr>
            <tr style="background: none;"><td style="border: none;"><span class="badge-pk">PK</span></td><td style="border: none;">Primary Key — Kunci utama tabel</td></tr>
            <tr style="background: none;"><td style="border: none;"><span class="badge-fk">FK</span></td><td style="border: none;">Foreign Key — Kunci asing (referensi ke tabel lain)</td></tr>
            <tr style="background: none;"><td style="border: none;"><span class="badge-uk">UNIQUE</span></td><td style="border: none;">Unique Key — Nilai harus unik</td></tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <h3>Diagram Alur Relasi Utama</h3>
    <pre style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 9pt; background: #F8F9FA; padding: 16pt; border: 1px solid #DEE2E6; line-height: 1.8;">
                                    ┌──────────────┐
                                    │   settings   │
                                    └──────────────┘

┌──────────┐    1:1    ┌────────────────────┐    1:1    ┌──────────┐
│  users   │──────────▶│ homeroom_teachers   │◀──────────│ classes  │
└──────────┘           └────────────────────┘           └──────────┘
     │                                                       │
